<title>CHINA: Trading in Whimsy Ent shares suspended. [CORRECTED 04:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>Trading in Whimsy Ent shares suspended. [CORRECTED 04:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Whimsy Entertainment Co Ltd was suspended on Tuesday morning at the request of the Hong Kong stock exchange pending an announcement, the exchange said. (Corrects source of request from &quot;the company&quot; to &quot;the Hong Kong stock exchange.)</p>
<p>On Monday, shares of the amusement centre operator added HK$0.03 to HK$1.80.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
